### Team Task Tracker API - Phase 1 Auth Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api

### 1. Register a new Admin user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin User",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 2. Register a new Member user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Member",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "member"
}

### 3. Login with registered user credentials
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store tokens from login response:
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.refreshToken}}

### 4. Refresh access token using refreshToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 5. Get current authenticated user profile (GET /api/auth/me/)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
